#: src/reference/lints.md:49
msgid "Checks if `hint-mostly-unused` being applied to all dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/lints.md:51 src/reference/lints.md:87
#: src/reference/lints.md:135 src/reference/lints.md:168
#: src/reference/lints.md:204 src/reference/lints.md:236
